        <mxCell id="pod_asm" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=5;arcSize=6;" value="dgcl-assembly               x2&#10;cmd: celery worker -Q q.assemble -c 8&#10;&#10;• chord barrier: waits for all docs&#10;• runs the 3 parallel checkers&#10;• builds the 12-point DGCL scorecard&#10;• idempotent push to S3&#10;&#10;node: CPU   port: none" vertex="1">
